I do a lot of prep before I hit the mines on a protection run. This includes:

1) Grow the pet.
2) Clear out shops for good/money from DL 2-4
3) Gather and wear any non cursed armor. The goal is to get a negative AC
before hitting the mines.
4) Pray for HPs. The OP can come back and ask how to do it if interested.

> So if you manage to get out of that situation, get
>back to level 1 asap and train that kitten till it's a large cat. It
>may take some time but it's almost a necessity if you want to survive
>at XL 1 in the mines.

Since you're not killing anything, it doesn't take that long. Also you don't
need to go back to DL1. The next big monster bump seems to occur at DL5. So
anywhere from DL1-4 is fine.

Again XL1 isn't the goal of the proection run. There's a ton of money in
the upper level shops and in minetown. You can get to a naked AC of 1 easily
at XL2 or XL3. It's only at XL4 that it starts to get a bit tough.

